# TT.EVENT_INTERFACE -- add_history_event (S-EVENT-042), demote_event / promote_event
# (S-EVENT-043/044) and moveevent (S-EVENT-033, S-EVENT-046, S-EVENT-047).
#
# known.diff -- the CORRECTED moveevent (DEVIATION(ORACLE-BUG), spec CORRECTION clauses
# S-EVENT-046/047, branch phoenix/migrate_tt_only). Oracle's UPDATE never reads p_event_id and
# re-parents EVERY event of p_oldticket_id ("FIXME / BROKEN ... This moves ALL events of a
# ticket", ddl/src/pkgb/tt_event_interface.sql:866); the translation moves only the named
# event. The steps are ordered so the difference is fully visible:
#   step 31 moves the DECOY event 957323 (which is on ticket 957313) "from 957311 to 957312":
#           Oracle moves 957321 AND 957322 (all events of 957311), PostgreSQL moves nothing
#           (S-EVENT-047 i: event not on the old ticket -> silent no-op);
#   step 32 moves 957321 from 957311 to 957312: Oracle has nothing left to move, PostgreSQL
#           moves exactly 957321 (S-EVENT-046);
#   step 33 moves the NONEXISTENT event 957999999 "from 957313 to 957312": Oracle moves 957323
#           (all events of 957313), PostgreSQL logs 'event does not exist' and moves nothing
#           (S-EVENT-047 ii);
#   steps 34/35 (nonexistent new ticket -> NO_DATA_FOUND swallowed; NULL event id -> gate)
#           agree.
# Net difference frozen in known.diff: 957322 and 957323 end on ticket 957312 on Oracle and
# stay on 957311 / 957313 on PostgreSQL. Every step reports 'ok' on both sides (S-EVENT-033:
# nothing moveevent does is ever observable to its caller).
#
# add_history_event has no handler at all (S-EVENT-042): with deferred FKs a nonexistent ticket
# id is accepted by both engines (the row is written, event_notify swallows its own failure).
# demote_event / promote_event raise NO_DATA_FOUND (P0002) unhandled for a nonexistent event.
#
# ORA_USER=system: fixtures insert into stop.company, stop.contact, mss.host, mss.service,
# mss.host2service.
ORA_USER=system
COMMITS=no
COMPARE_MSG=no
DESCRIPTION=add_history_event (public, private, nonexistent ticket), demote_event / promote_event (flag flips, P0002 on a nonexistent event), moveevent (corrected single-event move vs Oracle's move-all: known.diff S-EVENT-046/047)
